// Phase 9 — deterministic derived order (REACTIVE_SPEC v0.1 §2.1)
// Chained derived nodes recompute in ascending id order each flush.

REMEMBER base AS 1
THE d1 IS base ADD 1
THE d2 IS d1 ADD 1
THE d3 IS d2 ADD 1

SPEAK "chain=" AND d3

INCREASE base BY 10
SPEAK "chain=" AND d3
SPEAK "derived_runs=" AND THE DERIVED RUN COUNT
SPEAK "epoch=" AND THE EPOCH
